{"ID":"20240205153655-9z9dv6g","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240205153655-9z9dv6g","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153655-9z9dv6g\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105933-j0oyaxz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607095544-w5z8r8o\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:4130,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105933-j0oyaxz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"028茺蔚子\u0026amp;益母草","type":"doc","updated":"20240802092538"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105933-j0oyaxz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105933-j0oyaxz","updated":"20240206110000"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茺蔚子"}]},{"ID":"20240206094755-dq9w6w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094755-dq9w6w5","updated":"20240206094803"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t各地均产。\n【性状】\t呈三棱形，长2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3mm，宽约1.5mm。表面灰棕色至灰褐色，有深色斑点，一端稍宽，平截状，另一端渐窄而钝尖。果皮薄，子叶类白色，富油性。无臭，味苦。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t活血调经、清肝明目的功能。生茺蔚子长于清肝明目。用于目赤肿痛或目生翳膜。\n【炙品】\t炒茺蔚子：取净茺蔚子，置预热炒制容器内，用文火加热，炒至有爆声，微隆起，颜色加深，内部黄色，逸出香气时，取出晾凉。表面微鼓起，色泽加深，质脆，具香气。 寒凉之性缓和，并且质地酥脆，易于粉碎和煎出成分。长于活血调经。用于经闭，月经不调，痛经。"}]},{"ID":"20240206094756-j74egn9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094756-j74egn9","updated":"20240206094756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094756-nvr650t.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240206105937-l487316","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105937-l487316","updated":"20240206105940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"益母草"}]},{"ID":"20240206105949-qqc7yys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105949-qqc7yys","updated":"20240206105956"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t全国各地均产。\n【性状】\t鲜益母草：幼苗期无茎，基生叶圆心形，边缘59浅裂，每裂片有23钝齿。花前期茎呈方柱形，上部多分枝，四面凹下成纵沟，长3060cm，直径0.20.5cm ；表面青绿色；质鲜嫩，断面中部有髓。叶交互对生，有柄；叶片青绿色，质鲜嫩，揉之有汁；下部茎生叶掌状3 裂，上部叶羽状深裂或浅裂成3 片，裂片全缘或具少数锯齿。气微，味微苦。\n干益母草：茎表面灰绿色或黄绿色；体轻，质韧，断面中部有髓。叶片灰绿色，多皱缩、破碎，易脱落。轮伞花序腋生，小花淡紫色，花萼筒状，花冠二唇形。切段者长约2cm。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，凉。\n【功效】\t活血、祛淤、调经、消水。治疗妇女月经不调，胎漏难产，胞衣不下，产后血晕，瘀血腹痛，崩中漏下，尿血、泻血，痈肿疮疡。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105946-d1fpq0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105946-d1fpq0q","updated":"20240206105946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105946-09bifs3.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163543-8gzdqqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163543-8gzdqqa","updated":"20240205163543"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"益母草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/益母草-20240205163543-5sdxbkb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802083424-yvdghnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802083424-yvdghnu","updated":"20240802083424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"益母草"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/益母草-20240802083424-xih405u.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240618125655-55tqgcx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618125655-55tqgcx","updated":"20240802083659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 762px;","style":"width: 752px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"益母草 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/益母草 2-20240802083637-0m1hb8z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 752px;\" parent-style=\"width: 762px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 461px;","style":"width: 451px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"益母草 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/益母草 1-20240802083508-yejd89v.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 451px;\" parent-style=\"width: 461px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240802085311-um51ihi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240802085311-um51ihi","updated":"20240802085338"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"益母草 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/益母草 6-20240802085338-uz2c9iu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 610px;"